# .scrub-exclude — paths NOT included in the eng -> public promote.
#
# Read by scripts/release/promote.sh at Step 2. Each non-comment,
# non-blank line names a path (relative to the repo root) that will
# be removed from the staging tree before the squash commit against
# the public repo is built.
#
# Format: one path per line; blank lines and `#` comments allowed.
# Paths are removed with `rm -rf` — a file, a directory, or a glob-
# expandable pattern all work. Test paths carefully with
# `--dry-run` first.
#
# What currently ships as eng-only:

DEVELOPING.md
.scrub-exclude
scripts/release/
scripts/test/
